id: power-battery
name: Power Battery
order: 2
optionOf: energy-core
optionEffect: 4
description: >
  Reduce the Ki Point Cost of all Attacking Maneuvers by 2(T) and you always benefit from Ki Multiplier (see — Forms) even when you are not in a Form, but you cannot regain Ki Points through Ki Surges or Combat Recovery. If you would gain Ki Multiplier from another source, increase your Combat Rolls by 1(bT) instead.
text: >
  Power Battery [Passive]: Reduce the Ki Point Cost of all Attacking Maneuvers by 2(T) and you always benefit from Ki Multiplier (see — Forms) even when you are not in a Form, but you cannot regain Ki Points through Ki Surges or Combat Recovery. If you would gain Ki Multiplier from another source, increase your Combat Rolls by 1(bT) instead.

---

# (4) Ki Multiplier always (actor-character.mjs); none regained through a Ki Surge or Combat Recovery (`kiLocked`). Ki
# Multiplier from another source - the sheet's own box, until Forms are built - Combat Rolls +1(bT) instead.
[passive]
attack.kiCost -= 2(T);
allow kiMultiplier.always;
allow ki.noRegain;
if (kiMultiplied) {
    combatRolls += 1(bT);
}

# (5) Ki Points over the Max Capacity: Soak Value +1(bT) (actor-character.mjs, once the Capacity is known) and Combat
# Rolls +1(bT).
allow powerBattery.overCapacity;
if (ki.value > capacity.max) {
    combatRolls += 1(bT);
}
